{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>25歲美國女模Adison Justis不時於社交網站分享性感照益粉絲，其中她穿上藍色比堅尼度假時，背靠一架外型獨特的無車門座駕合照，原來是一架英國電動沙灘休閒車。該車種本來是為英軍設計的輕型多用途越野軍車，但因輪胎太小與底盤太低被棄案，最後轉型成為民用休閒車。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:43.020968+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:01:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:08.406138+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:27.473764+00:00","content_hash":"7ab267bdd1979eb455b38d24866929f72e7b8fe1b7fdc01cc50d4783a4862e37","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:43.020968+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}